+      "title": "What you already know",
+      "content": "You know *para que* + subjunctive from B1 Unit 4: it says the purpose of an action when the second clause has a new subject (*Te llamo para que vengas*). With the same subject you use *para* + infinitive. Treaties and summits exist for a purpose, so this pattern is at home here. Here it works on the Amazon Cooperation Treaty."
