+      "content": "You know *si hubiera* + participle with the simple conditional from B2 Unit 11 (the mixed conditional): *si hubiera* + participle for a past that did not happen, with the simple conditional for a result in the present (*Si hubiera estudiado, ahora sería médica*). It is the natural tool for \"if we had ..., today there would be ...\". Here it works on the Amazon and its standing-forest economy."
