+          "*cuando* + preterite: an event, then its result"
         ],
         [
-          "Nada más atracar el vapor en el puerto de Manaus, los estibadores descargaron el caucho.",
-          "As soon as the steamship docked at the port of Manaus, the stevedores unloaded the rubber."
