+      "title": "What you already know",
+      "content": "You know *en cambio*, *por el contrario*, *al contrario*, *no obstante* and *ahora bien* from B2 Unit 30. Each sets one idea against another in its own way. The Cerrado, a savanna that became a farming giant, has a productive side and an environmental side. Here the markers work on the Cerrado."
